{"id":"cb69813e33c9d141","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-func-eigenvector.md","title":"ZFC Func Eigenvector","display":"df-zfc-func-eigenvector — ZFC Func Eigenvector","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-func-eigenvector","aliases":["58-df-zfc-func-eigenvector"],"display":"df-zfc-func-eigenvector — ZFC Func Eigenvector","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-func-eigenvector"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-func-eigenvector</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-func-eigenvector — ZFC Func Eigenvector"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,V,+_V,\\cdot_V,0_V,T,x,\\lambda\\in V,\\ x\\in V,\\ \\lambda\\in k\">\\(k,V,+_V,\\cdot_V,0_V,T,x,\\lambda\\in V,\\ x\\in V,\\ \\lambda\\in k\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvector}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvector}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}eigenvector}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvector}_S(x,\\lambda,T,V,k,+_V,\\cdot_V,0_V)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,k,+_V,\\cdot_V,+_V,\\cdot_V)\\land 0_V\\in V\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;(0_V+_Vv=v=v+_V0_V)\\land x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\land \\lambda\\in k\\land T(x)=\\lambda\\cdot_V x\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}eigenvector}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvector}_S(x,\\lambda,T,V,k,+_V,\\cdot_V,0_V)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,k,+_V,\\cdot_V,+_V,\\cdot_V)\\land 0_V\\in V\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;(0_V+_Vv=v=v+_V0_V)\\land x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\land \\lambda\\in k\\land T(x)=\\lambda\\cdot_V x\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The linear-map predicate already supplies one shared explicit field/vector-space witness for the designated operations. Removing a second carrier-level vector-space call prevents two unrelated hidden scalar-field structures from being selected.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":".